This is another mental shift worth making.

Historically:

```text
DOMAIN NETWORK
     │
     ├── AD
     ├── RSA
     ├── Admin systems
     ├── Users
     └── Other trusted systems
```

So **AD security and Domain network security became mentally coupled**.

In the greenfield design, think of AD as a **protected identity service**:

```text
                  tc.org AD
                     ▲
                     │
              Identity Service
                     │
          ┌──────────┼───────────┐
          │          │           │
      Keycloak     Admin       Other
