Our old architecture needed:

```text
Domain AD
   │
   ▼
Segment1 RODC
   │
   ▼
Segment1 services
```

because the security boundary largely prohibited direct communication.

In the new architecture, we can ask the more fundamental question:

> **Why does an RODC need to exist?**

If the answer is merely:

