## Yes, I like DNS on the recovery VM

Given *our particular recovery premise*, a tiny authoritative DNS service on the IaC/recovery VM makes a lot of sense.

Remember what we're trying to accomplish: AD/DNS and higher services may be gone, but VCF needs name resolution during reconstruction. DNS therefore cannot depend upon VCF or AD.

I'd favor:

```text
