I would make that an explicit lab assumption:

**`FND-LAB-002 — Isolated Nested VCF Sandbox — CONFIRMED`**
The VCF 9.1.1 nested validation environment resides on isolated lab port groups with unrestricted private IP allocation inside the sandbox. Administrative access originates through a jump box connected to an authorized sandbox port group. The sandbox does not depend on production DNS, AD, Keycloak, routing, or other enterprise services for VCF reconstruction.

That lets us deliberately design the sandbox from scratch:

```text
